/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 61 0 R
/T (The central idea is to create a compact energy-monitoring arrangement in which electrical quantities are sensed, converted into digital form, processed and displayed. The presentation identifies the ESP32, ACS712 current sensor, ZMPT101B voltage sensor, LCD display, I2C module, breadboard and jumper wires as the main hardware components.)
/E (The central idea is to create a compact energy-monitoring arrangement in which electrical quantities are sensed, converted into digital form, processed and displayed. The presentation identifies the ESP32, ACS712 current sensor, ZMPT101B voltage sensor, LCD display, I2C module, breadboard and jumper wires as the main hardware components.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
