/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (By studying the project, learners can understand the relationship between analog signals and digital systems, the role of sensors in measurement, the function of a microcontroller, and the use of a communication interface to connect a display. It also provides an example of how separate hardware modules can be combined into one embedded system.)
/E (By studying the project, learners can understand the relationship between analog signals and digital systems, the role of sensors in measurement, the function of a microcontroller, and the use of a communication interface to connect a display. It also provides an example of how separate hardware modules can be combined into one embedded system.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
