437 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Smart Electric Meter is an electronic measuring system designed to monitor electrical parameters and present the readings digitally. The project uses voltage and current sensors to collect measurements from an electrical setup. An ESP32 microcontroller acts as the main processing unit. The sensor outputs are converted into digital values, processed by the controller, and displayed on an LCD. The project demonstrates how sensing, analog-to-digital conversion, embedded processing and display interfacing work together in a practical digital-electronics application.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 334 0 R
>>
endobj
