/Title (By studying the project, learners can understand the relationship between analog signals and digital systems, the role of sensors in measurement, the function of a microcontroller, and the use of a communication interface to connect a display. It also provides an example of how separate hardware modules can be combined into one embedded system.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 441 0 R
>>
endobj
