/Title (The project covers the sensing and display path of an electronic meter. It begins with an electrical supply and connected load. Voltage and current sensors detect the corresponding parameters and provide analog outputs. The ESP32 converts the sensor signals into digital values using its ADC and processes the readings. Finally, the information is transferred to the LCD through the I2C module.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 502 0 R
/Next 562 0 R
>>
endobj
562 0 obj
<<
/Title (The scope described in the presentation is focused on measurement and local display. Features such as mobile-app monitoring, cloud storage, automatic bill calculation and overload alerts are listed as possible future improvements rather than confirmed features of the present prototype.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 502 0 R
/Prev 561 0 R
>>
endobj
